#
# languages/dotnet/assembly, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib): a
# .NET assembly's file, its tables' shapes (Metadata), its bytes read
# (Image), its signatures and IL (Signature, Il), printed (Listing) and
# written (Writer). mini-dotnet reads assemblies with it; mini-cc,
# mini-ml, mini-csc, mini-tiger and mini-datalog write theirs. Each
# compiled its own copy of the units before, by rules in its mkfile
# (plan_simpler_builds.md, step 4).
TOP=../../..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=languages/dotnet/assembly
DIRS=.
NEEDS=
UNITS=Metadata Image Signature Il Listing Writer
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
